CPZ UI
======

Menu and tabs
-------------
  Alt+O          Open the application menu
  Alt+T          New tab
  Alt+W          Close the current tab
  Alt+Left       Previous tab
  Alt+Right      Next tab
  Alt+1..9       Select tab

Terminal
--------
  Ctrl+Shift+C   Copy selection
  Ctrl+Shift+V   Paste
  Shift+PageUp   Scroll back
  Shift+PageDown Scroll forward

Language
--------
  Alt+Shift      Switch keyboard layout (us, ua)

Session
-------
  The tmux server survives a compositor restart, a terminal restart and an
  output switch. Closing a foreground application returns to the same tab.

  Recovery is available over the serial console and SSH.
